{"description":"Investigate lost changes","kind":"TaskAction","prompt":"I need you to investigate a git situation where a user made changes to their personal site but after checking out master, they can't find those changes anymore. They want to find and merge those changes into master.\n\nPlease inspect the current environment:\n1. Check the git status and current branch\n2. Look at git log to see recent commits\n3. Check if there are any uncommitted changes or stashed changes\n4. Look for any branches that might contain the user's changes\n5. Identify what changes were made and where they currently are\n6. Determine the best way to merge them into master\n\nProvide a detailed report of:\n- Current state of the repository\n- What changes exist and where they are located\n- The likely root cause of why changes aren't visible\n- A practical verification strategy to confirm the solution\n\nDo NOT make any changes - only investigate and report back.","subagent_type":"benchmark-navigator"}
